                <div class="invisible absolute inset-0 right-0 left-auto flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-950 bg-white p-8 md:p-12 opacity-0 scale-95 transition-opacity group-hover:visible group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-100 md:w-[calc(300%+4rem)] shadow-2xl">
                    <div class="absolute -top-8 right-12 flex h-16 w-24 items-center justify-center rounded-t-2xl border-2 border-b-0 border-indigo-950 bg-white">
                        <Image src={buttonSlidersIcon} alt="Processing Icon" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 mt-4">
                        <div class="md:w-3/5">
                             <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-950 mb-4">Engenharia, Processamento e Qualidade de Dados</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-indigo-950/80 py-6 md:py-10">Desenvolvemos aplicações e soluções digitais leves que otimizam processos internos, melhoram a colaboração e aceleram a adoção de práticas data-driven.</p>
                        </div>
                        <ul class="md:w-2/5 border-l border-indigo-950/20 pl-8 py-6 md:py-10 space-y-3 text-indigo-950 font-medium text-sm md:text-base">
                            <li>• Integração de dados</li>
